Manage projects

Usage:
  paso project [flags]
  paso project [command]

Available Commands:
  create      Create a new project
  delete      Delete a project
  git-link    Link a project to a git branch
  git-unlink  Unlink a project from its git branch
  list        List all projects
  tree        Display tasks in a tree structure

Flags:
  -j, --json           Output in JSON format (used with --show-current)
  -q, --quiet          Minimal output - ID only (used with --show-current)
  -s, --show-current   Show the project associated with the current git branch

Use "paso project [command] --help" for more information about a command.
